<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Nhân viên - Nhà Hàng Bảo Đoàn</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/startbootstrap-sb-admin-2/4.1.4/css/sb-admin-2.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/5.15.4/css/all.min.css">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Nunito', 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background:#f8f9fc; }
    .sidebar { background: linear-gradient(180deg,#4e342e 0%,#2c1810 100%) !important; min-height:100vh; }
    .sidebar .nav-item .nav-link { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); }
    .sidebar .nav-item.active .nav-link, .sidebar .nav-item .nav-link:hover { color:#fff; }
    /* sb-admin-2 in hoa ten thuong hieu o sidebar; tat di de hien dung hoa/thuong nhu thiet ke */
    .sidebar-brand { color:#fff !important; font-weight:800; text-transform: none !important; }
    .badge-unread { background:#e74a3b; color:#fff; border-radius:50%; padding:2px 6px; font-size:11px; }
    .staff-avatar { width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:50%; background:#c8a951; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px; }
    .card { border:none; box-shadow:0 .15rem 1.75rem 0 rgba(58,59,69,.15); }

    /* Man che ngan keo. Khai bao NGOAI diem ngat de tren may tinh no cung la
       display:none tuong minh - JS them the nay vao moi trang, de mac dinh thi
       no la mot <div> tro khong kieu nam lo lung cuoi <body>. */
    .sb-che { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.45); z-index: 1040; display: none; }

    /* ===================================================================
       DIEN THOAI - thanh ben thanh ngan keo truot
       ===================================================================

       Do tren Chrome kho 390x844 (iPhone 14), trang /staff:

         thanh ben   104px  (6.5rem - dai bieu tuong hep cua sb-admin-2)
         noi dung    286px  (73% man hinh, phan con lai)
         .nav-link span  hien, rong 72px trong dai 104px
         .sidebar-brand  104x70px chua chu 20px "Nha Hang Bao Doan"

       sb-admin-2 co hai trang thai: mo rong (14rem, co chu) va thu gon
       (6.5rem, CHI bieu tuong - lop .toggled an the <span> di). Duoi 768px no
       ep be ngang xuong 6.5rem NHUNG khong tu them .toggled, nen chu van hien
       trong dai rong 104px: nhan menu xuong 2-3 dong, con ten nha hang xuong 3
       dong tran khoi o cao 70px va DE LEN muc "Tong quan" ngay duoi.

       JS cua sb-admin-2 chi them .toggled trong su kien `resize`, khong chay
       luc nap trang - nen mo tren dien thoai la dinh ngay trang thai hong nay.

       Chon ngan keo truot chu khong phai dai bieu tuong: tren 390px thi 104px
       la hon mot phan tu man hinh, ma man hinh nhan vien toan bang bieu va
       danh sach - can tung pixel be ngang. Ngan keo tra lai het 390px cho noi
       dung, va nut ba gach (#sidebarToggleTop) thi da co san.
       =================================================================== */
    @media (max-width: 767.98px) {
      /* Ghi de ca .toggled: duoi day ngan keo chi co dong/mo, khong con khai
         niem "thu gon" cua sb-admin-2 nua. */
      .sidebar, .sidebar.toggled {
        position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; bottom: 0; z-index: 1045;
        width: 15rem !important; min-height: 100vh;
        transform: translateX(-100%); transition: transform .25s ease;
        overflow-y: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      }
      body.sb-mo .sidebar, body.sb-mo .sidebar.toggled { transform: none; }

      /* Tra lai nhan chu - .toggled cua sb-admin-2 an chung di */
      .sidebar .nav-item .nav-link span,
      .sidebar.toggled .nav-item .nav-link span { display: inline !important; font-size: 15px; }
      .sidebar .nav-item .nav-link,
      .sidebar.toggled .nav-item .nav-link {
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem;
        padding: .8rem 1.1rem; min-height: 48px; text-align: left; width: 100%;
      }
      .sidebar .nav-item .nav-link i { width: 20px; text-align: center; }
      .sidebar .sidebar-heading, .sidebar.toggled .sidebar-heading {
        display: block !important; text-align: left !important; }
      .sidebar-brand { height: auto !important; padding: 1rem !important; }
      .sidebar-brand span { font-size: 17px !important; }

      #content-wrapper { width: 100%; margin-left: 0 !important; }

      /* Man che: bam ra ngoai la dong ngan keo - cu chi quen thuoc, va no cung
         ngan viec bam nham vao noi dung dang bi ngan keo phu len. */
      body.sb-mo .sb-che { display: block; }
      body.sb-mo { overflow: hidden; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body id="page-top">

<!--
  Socket.io + thu vien RT phai nap O DAY, truoc noi dung trang.

  Truoc day hai the nay nam trong footer.ejs - tuc la SAU cac khoi <script> cua
  tung trang. Nhung trang goi RT ngay dau khoi (vi du `var E = RT.escapeHtml`
  o /to-chuc/khuon-mat va /dieu-hanh) nem ReferenceError va CHET CA KHOI: bang
  danh sach khong ve, dong bo thoi gian thuc khong chay. Chinh comment dau file
  realtime-to-chuc.js cung ghi "nap mot lan trong header.ejs" - o day moi dung.

  Dat sau <body> chu khong trong <head> vi thu vien co dung document.body.
-->
<script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
<script src="/realtime-to-chuc.js"></script>

<div id="wrapper">
  <!-- Sidebar -->
  <ul class="navbar-nav sidebar sidebar-dark accordion" id="accordionSidebar">
    <a class="sidebar-brand d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center py-3" href="/staff">
      <%- include('../../partials/logo-bd', { cao: 26, mau: '#c8a951' }) %>
      <span style="font-size:20px; margin-left:8px;">Nhà Hàng Bảo Đoàn</span>
    </a>
    <hr class="sidebar-divider my-0">
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='dashboard' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-tachometer-alt"></i><span>Tổng quan</span></a>
    </li>
    <hr class="sidebar-divider">
    <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Nghiệp vụ</div>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='bookings' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/bookings"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-book"></i><span>Quản lý Đặt bàn</span></a>
    </li>
<%
     /* Dung `dongVaiDuoc` chu khong so sanh `session.staffRole`: staffRole la
        chucvu_legacy, ma "Quan ly nha hang" mang legacy 'Quan ly' nen se bi
        an mat menu Thu ngan du ho vao duoc trang. */
  %>
    <% if (typeof dongVaiDuoc === 'function' && dongVaiDuoc(['Thu ngan', 'Quay', 'Ke toan', 'Phuc vu'])) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='thanh-toan' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/thanh-toan">
          <i class="fas fa-fw fa-cash-register"></i><span>Thu ngân</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='chot-ca' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/chot-ca">
          <i class="fas fa-fw fa-calculator"></i><span>Chốt ca thu ngân</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    <% } %>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='kitchen' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/kitchen">
        <i class="fas fa-fw fa-utensils"></i>
        <span><%= session.staffRole === 'Phuc vu' ? 'Món đã xong' : 'Quản lý Đơn bàn' %></span>
      </a>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='kds' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/kds"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-fire"></i><span>Màn hình bếp (KDS)</span></a>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='sodoban' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/so-do-ban"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-th"></i><span>Sơ đồ bàn</span></a>
    </li>
    <%
      /* Dieu phoi giao hang: chan bang dung QUYEN ma route dang doi
         (`giao_hang.xem` trong routes/vanChuyen.js). Menu rong hon route thi
         nguoi dung thay muc roi bam vao nhan 403; hep hon thi ho khong bao gio
         tim thay chuc nang minh duoc phep dung. */
    %>
    <% if (typeof coQuyen === 'function' && coQuyen('giao_hang.xem')) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='giao-hang' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/giao-hang">
          <i class="fas fa-fw fa-motorcycle"></i><span>Điều phối giao hàng</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    <% } %>
    <hr class="sidebar-divider">
    <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Tổ chức</div>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='to-chuc' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/to-chuc"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-sitemap"></i><span>Sơ đồ tổ chức</span></a>
    </li>
    <% if (typeof coQuyen === 'function' && coQuyen('dieu_hanh.bang_dieu_khien')) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='dieu-hanh' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/dieu-hanh">
          <i class="fas fa-fw fa-satellite-dish"></i><span>Bảng điều hành</span>
          <span class="badge badge-danger badge-unread ml-1 d-none" id="sl-viec-cho">0</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    <% } %>
    <%
      /* Quản lý chấm công: chỉ cấp 1 (Quản lý nhà hàng).
         Điều kiện phải trùng khớp với canCapBac(1) ở routes/chamCong.js —
         nếu ở đây rộng hơn route thì người dùng thấy mục menu rồi bấm vào
         nhận 403, tệ hơn là không thấy gì. */
    %>
    <% if (typeof tuCapBac === 'function' && tuCapBac(1)) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='cham-cong-quan-ly' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/to-chuc/cham-cong">
          <i class="fas fa-fw fa-user-clock"></i><span>Quản lý chấm công</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    <% } %>
    <% if (typeof coQuyen === 'function' && coQuyen(['to_chuc.chuc_danh','to_chuc.bo_nhiem','to_chuc.phan_quyen'])) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='to-chuc-quan-ly' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/to-chuc/quan-ly"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-user-cog"></i><span>Quản lý tổ chức</span></a>
      </li>
    <% } %>

    <hr class="sidebar-divider">
    <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Phân tích &amp; AI</div>
    <li class="nav-item">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/analytics"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-chart-bar"></i><span>Dashboard phân tích</span></a>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/du-bao"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-brain"></i><span>Dự báo AI</span></a>
    </li>
    <hr class="sidebar-divider">
    <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Làm việc</div>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='schedule' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/schedule"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-calendar-alt"></i><span>Lịch làm việc</span></a>
    </li>
    <%
      /* MỘT mục cho chấm công, không phải hai.

         Trước đây ở đây có thêm mục "Khuôn mặt của tôi" trỏ tới /staff/khuon-mat.
         Hai mục cạnh nhau nhưng cùng dẫn tới một việc — cả hai trang đều có máy
         tự chấm công 1:1 — nên nhân viên phải đoán. Nay đăng ký khuôn mặt nằm
         ngay trong trang chấm công, và /staff/khuon-mat chuyển hướng về đó. */
    %>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && (activePage==='attendance' || activePage==='khuon-mat') ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/attendance"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-clock"></i><span>Chấm công (khuôn mặt)</span></a>
    </li>
    <% if (typeof coQuyen === 'function' && coQuyen(['nhansu.cham_cong.sua','nhansu.cham_cong.xem'])) { %>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='khuon-mat-quan-ly' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/to-chuc/khuon-mat"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-users-cog"></i><span>QL chấm công khuôn mặt</span></a>
      </li>
    <% } %>

    <% if (['Ke toan', 'Quay', 'Thu ngan'].includes(session.staffRole)) { %>
      <hr class="sidebar-divider">
      <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Quản trị Tài chính & Khách hàng</div>
      
      <% if (session.staffRole === 'Ke toan') { %>
        <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='salary' ? 'active' : '' %>">
          <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/accountant/salary"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-money-check-alt"></i><span>Quản lý Lương</span></a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='reports' ? 'active' : '' %>">
          <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/accountant/reports"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-chart-line"></i><span>Báo cáo Thu chi</span></a>
        </li>
      <% } %>

      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='customers' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/customers"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-users"></i><span>Khách hàng</span></a>
      </li>

      <% if (session.staffRole === 'Ke toan') { %>
        <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='staff-manage' ? 'active' : '' %>">
          <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/accountant/staff"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-users-cog"></i><span>Danh sách Nhân viên</span></a>
        </li>
      <% } %>

      <hr class="sidebar-divider">
      <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Giao tiếp</div>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='chat' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/chat"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-comments"></i><span>Chat khách hàng</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='emails' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/emails"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-envelope"></i><span>Gửi Email</span></a>
      </li>

    <% } else if (session.staffRole === 'Bep') { %>
      <hr class="sidebar-divider">
      <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Quản lý kho & Sản xuất</div>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='inventory' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/kitchen/inventory"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-boxes"></i><span>Nguyên liệu & Kho</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='recipes' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/kitchen/recipes"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-scroll"></i><span>Công thức nấu ăn</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='kitchen-menu' ? 'active' : '' %>">
          <a class="nav-link collapsed" href="#" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseMenu" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseMenu">
              <i class="fas fa-fw fa-list"></i><span>Thực đơn & Combo</span>
          </a>
          <div id="collapseMenu" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-parent="#accordionSidebar">
              <div class="bg-white py-2 collapse-inner rounded">
                  <a class="collapse-item" href="/staff/kitchen/categories">Loại món</a>
                  <a class="collapse-item" href="/staff/kitchen/dishes">Món ăn</a>
                  <a class="collapse-item" href="/staff/kitchen/combos">Combo</a>
              </div>
          </div>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='equipment' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/kitchen/equipment"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-tools"></i><span>Trang thiết bị</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='kitchen-shift' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/kitchen/shift"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-stopwatch"></i><span>Chốt ca Bếp</span></a>
      </li>

    <% } else if (session.staffRole === 'Phuc vu') { %>
      <hr class="sidebar-divider">
      <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Giao tiếp & Dịch vụ</div>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='qr-codes' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/qr-codes"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-qrcode"></i><span>Mã QR Đặt Món</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='chat' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/chat"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-comments"></i><span>Chat khách hàng</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='emails' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/emails"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-envelope"></i><span>Gửi Email</span></a>
      </li>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='notifications' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/notifications"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-bell"></i><span>Thông báo</span></a>
      </li>

    <% } else { %>
      <hr class="sidebar-divider">
      <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Giao tiếp</div>
      <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='notifications' ? 'active' : '' %>">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/notifications"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-bell"></i><span>Thông báo</span></a>
      </li>
    <% } %>

    <hr class="sidebar-divider">
    <div class="sidebar-heading text-uppercase px-3 mb-1" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.4); font-size:11px;">Tài khoản</div>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='leave' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/leave"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-calendar-minus"></i><span>Xin nghỉ phép</span></a>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item <%= typeof activePage !== 'undefined' && activePage==='profile' ? 'active' : '' %>">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/profile"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-user"></i><span>Thông tin cá nhân</span></a>
    </li>
    <li class="nav-item">
      <a class="nav-link" href="/staff/logout"><i class="fas fa-fw fa-sign-out-alt"></i><span>Đăng xuất</span></a>
    </li>
    <hr class="sidebar-divider d-none d-md-block">
  </ul>
  <!-- End Sidebar -->

  <!-- Content Wrapper -->
  <div id="content-wrapper" class="d-flex flex-column">
    <div id="content">
      <!-- Topbar -->
      <nav class="navbar navbar-expand navbar-light bg-white topbar mb-4 static-top shadow">
        <button id="sidebarToggleTop" class="btn btn-link d-md-none rounded-circle mr-3">
          <i class="fa fa-bars"></i>
        </button>
        <ul class="navbar-nav ml-auto align-items-center">
          <li class="nav-item mr-3 d-none d-md-block">
            <span id="rt-den" title="Kết nối thời gian thực"
                  style="display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#b7b9cc"></span>
            <span class="small text-gray-500 ml-1">thời gian thực</span>
          </li>
          <li class="nav-item d-flex align-items-center">
            <div class="staff-avatar mr-2"
                 style="<%= locals.hoSo && locals.hoSo.mau_bp ? 'background:' + locals.hoSo.mau_bp : '' %>">
              <%= typeof staffName !== 'undefined' && staffName ? staffName.charAt(0).toUpperCase() : 'N' %>
            </div>
            <div class="d-none d-lg-block mr-2" style="line-height:1.25">
              <div class="text-gray-700 small font-weight-bold">
                <%= typeof staffName !== 'undefined' ? staffName : 'Nhân viên' %>
              </div>
              <div class="text-gray-500" style="font-size:11px">
                <% if (locals.hoSo && locals.hoSo.ten_cd) { %>
                  <%= locals.hoSo.ten_cd %><% if (locals.hoSo.ten_bp) { %> · <%= locals.hoSo.ten_bp %><% } %>
                  <% if (locals.hoSo.uy_quyen && locals.hoSo.uy_quyen.length) { %>
                    <i class="fas fa-user-shield text-warning" title="Đang giữ ủy quyền tạm thời"></i>
                  <% } %>
                <% } else { %>
                  <span class="text-warning">chưa có chức danh</span>
                <% } %>
              </div>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
